<https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/claim/morphoeval-bailleul-allometric-cranial-sutures> a pk:Claim ;
    rdfs:label "Miura et al. (2009) & Jaslow (1990) cranial suture fractal interdigitation and Kuramoto-Sivashinsky osteogenic instability (Homo sapiens and Mus musculus sagittal and lambdoid calvarial skull sutures)",
        "Miura et al. (2009) & Jaslow (1990) cranial suture fractal interdigitation and Kuramoto-Sivashinsky osteogenic instability faithfully reproduces Homo sapiens and Mus musculus sagittal and lambdoid calvarial skull sutures morphology" ;
    dct:conformsTo <https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/math-law/bailleul-allometric-cranial-sutures-1>,
        <https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/math-law/bailleul-allometric-cranial-sutures-2>,
        <https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/math-law/bailleul-allometric-cranial-sutures-3> ;
    dct:description "The simulation script(s) 2020-bailleul-allometric-cranial-sutures.py implement the cited source model as published and produce forms that match real Homo sapiens and Mus musculus sagittal and lambdoid calvarial skull sutures specimens and the source authors' figures. A belief under audit, not a fact: its credibility is the weight of evidence (MorphoEval 0.1.0 overall 56.3/100, audit 2026-10-19-allometric-cranial-sutures-audit) and the assessments." ;
    dct:subject <https://github.com/fractastical/morpholib/blob/317bc3c/2020-bailleul-allometric-cranial-sutures.py> ;
    schema:about "Homo sapiens and Mus musculus sagittal and lambdoid calvarial skull sutures" ;
